\import{macros}
\meta{agent-authored}{true}
\taxon{Remark}
\title{Methodology boundary for audit}
\tag{ftip}
\p{Parts III and V of \citek{jarmak2026reliable} motivate durable execution,
review, and accountability practices. The audit taxonomy and conjunction
gates are proposed operational specifications; they do not establish that an audit is
complete or that a committed artifact is correct.}
